      "updated": 1790683200000,
      "created": 1790683200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FILTERS  School, year/period, account/head, class, mode, bank, status.\nREPORTS  Collection, outstanding/aging, refunds/concessions, bank\nbook, cash book, trial balance, income-expense, P&L, balance sheet.\nRULE  Student due = receivable control; debits = credits; clearing\nand statement differences have named exceptions.\nACTION  Drill down, export with permissions.",
      "originalText": "FILTERS  School, year/period, account/head, class, mode, bank, status.\nREPORTS  Collection, outstanding/aging, refunds/concessions, bank\nbook, cash book, trial balance, income-expense, P&L, balance sheet.\nRULE  Student due = receivable control; debits = credits; clearing\nand statement differences have named exceptions.\nACTION  Drill down, export with permissions.",
      "rawText": "FILTERS  School, year/period, account/head, class, mode, bank, status.\nREPORTS  Collection, outstanding/aging, refunds/concessions, bank\nbook, cash book, trial balance, income-expense, P&L, balance sheet.\nRULE  Student due = receivable control; debits = credits; clearing\nand statement differences have named exceptions.\nACTION  Drill down, export with permissions.",
