      "text": "Fee Structure: tuition INR 12,000 + transport INR 3,000.\nAssignment pins term/policy versions; demand total INR 15,000.\nPOST  Dr Student Receivable 15,000; Cr Tuition Income 12,000;\nCr Transport Income 3,000. Student due = INR 15,000.",
      "originalText": "Fee Structure: tuition INR 12,000 + transport INR 3,000.\nAssignment pins term/policy versions; demand total INR 15,000.\nPOST  Dr Student Receivable 15,000; Cr Tuition Income 12,000;\nCr Transport Income 3,000. Student due = INR 15,000.",
      "rawText": "Fee Structure: tuition INR 12,000 + transport INR 3,000.\nAssignment pins term/policy versions; demand total INR 15,000.\nPOST  Dr Student Receivable 15,000; Cr Tuition Income 12,000;\nCr Transport Income 3,000. Student due = INR 15,000.",
